<div class="am2r">
  <div class="am2r__wrap">
    <div class="am2r__head">
      <span class="am2r__rule"></span>
      <span class="am2r__eyebrow">In their words</span>
      <h2 class="am2r__title">Loved by clients</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="am2r__grid">
      <div class="am2r__card"><div class="am2r__stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>&ldquo;My girls and I love doing our nails together. They wear them for school, take them off for a game, then set them right back on after.&rdquo;</p><div class="am2r__who">Lucinda G. &middot; Verified</div></div>
      <div class="am2r__card"><div class="am2r__stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>&ldquo;Salon quality for a fraction of the price of gel. Once you try AM2Luxe, you will not go back to the salon.&rdquo;</p><div class="am2r__who">Lucinda G. &middot; Verified</div></div>
      <div class="am2r__card"><div class="am2r__stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>&ldquo;The color goes with everything and the gloss lasts. The manicure stays fresh. You will most definitely reorder.&rdquo;</p><div class="am2r__who">Manicure Fanatic &middot; Verified</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .am2r{--foil:linear-gradient(135deg,#8A6D2F,#D9BC75,#F4E7B8,#B8923F,#F0DB96,#9C7B3B,#D4B76A);background:#FBF9F4}
  .am2r__wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:92px 34px}
  .am2r__head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px}
  .am2r__rule{display:block;width:52px;height:2px;background:var(--foil);margin:0 auto 20px}
  .am2r__eyebrow{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--foil);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:transparent}
  .am2r__title{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:46px;color:#161311;margin:14px 0 0}
  .am2r__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px}
  .am2r__card{border:1px solid rgba(168,135,74,.35);padding:40px 32px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .am2r__stars{background:var(--foil);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:transparent;letter-spacing:.22em;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .am2r__card p{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#161311;flex:1;margin:0}
  .am2r__who{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B5349;margin-top:22px}
  @media(max-width:820px){.am2r__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:460px;margin:0 auto}.am2r__title{font-size:36px}}
</style>
